Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

SE-011 (seat 181407): nine own lawyers reached the model in every run,
but runs 1 and 4 showed "Nika advokati" twice and never Maka. The
Georgian-voice rewrite wrote „მაკა ადვოკატი"; the 3169 restorer let each
word drift two letters, so "Nika advokati" matched the span as well as
"Maka advokati", and the first name in the list took it.

Now every saved name that fits a span is scored by its summed drift, the
closest one is put back, and two equally close names leave the reply's own
words alone. The drift rule itself is unchanged (Mike Sample still comes
back from „მაიკ სემპლი").

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
